  "engine_mode": "shared_local_mesh_v1",
  "description_uk": "Пустотливо підморгує й показує язика, схиляючи голівку до лапки біля щоки. В іншій лапці тримає золоту зірку, а піднятою ніжкою робить маленький бічний акцент.",
  "semantics": {
    "core_scene": "One clear wink, tongue-out grin, actual single gold star gripped by one paw at chest, other paw touches cheek, one raised foot and separate playful side-kick/cape accent.",
    "omitted_optional_action": "Optional toss/catch omitted explicitly for semantic QA. Rejected v1 source0 was airborne with motion tails, not a star wand/stem or physical grip; it is not used. Exact54 starts with a real stable grip after the catch, without claiming to perform that catch.",
    "reversibility_or_contact": "Every gold-star boundary/interior point and same held wrist share one rotation; touching cheek/paw share head field with reduced wrist follow. Raised foot acts separately while three support-foot points stay grounded. No star handoff or backwards flight."
  },
